ass=\"wp-image-8159\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211014100509.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211014100509-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211014100509-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211014110029.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211014110029.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8160\" class=\"wp-image-8160\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211014110029.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211014110029-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211014110029-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211014111046.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211014111046.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8161\" class=\"wp-image-8161\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211014111046.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211014111046-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/20211014111046-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211014_111909229_HDR.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211014_111909229_HDR.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"8162\" class=\"wp-image-8162\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211014_111909229_HDR.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211014_111909229_HDR-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/10\/IMG_20211014_111909229_HDR-685x514.jpg 685w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Here&#8217;s a short (1-1\/2 minutes) video of some of the beauty we took in.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Dead Horse Point State Park near Moab, Utah\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/H14r4sgz4LU?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>And a special thanks to Clark and Anita for putting us on to this gem.  Next time we are going to be in the area, we&#8217;ll need to make campground reservations ahead of time!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks once again for riding along on the journey of our lifetimes.  It&#8217;s been five years now that we&#8217;ve traveled full-time and worked (volunteered) part-time along the way and it&#8217;s still fun &#8211; how about that!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Until we meet again, take care of yourselves and each other.  You&#8217;re all you&#8217;ve got.  Be good.  And stay safe in this crazy world of ours.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Herb and Kathy<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>When we stayed a couple weeks at Angostura Recreation Area (Hot Springs SD) you&#8217;ll remember that we had the pleasure of meeting and visiting 